sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant GDBPane as GDBWidget
    participant IOPane as OutputWidget
    participant Client as gdb.GDBClient
    participant CLIPTY as PTY#1 CLI
    participant MIPTY as PTY#2 MI
    participant InfPTY as PTY#3 inferior
    participant GDB as GDB
    participant Prog as Program

    Note over Client,InfPTY: Startup (3 PTY)
    Client->>CLIPTY: ptyx.Start(gdb console mode)
    Client->>MIPTY: ptyx.Open()
    Client->>InfPTY: ptyx.Open()
    Client->>CLIPTY: new-ui mi2 /dev/pts/N
    Client->>MIPTY: -inferior-tty-set /dev/pts/M
    Note over GDB,Prog: run attaches program to PTY#3 slave

    User->>GDBPane: type q / commands
    GDBPane->>CLIPTY: WireTTY SendRaw (CLI PTY)
    CLIPTY->>GDB: readline / console
    GDB-->>MIPTY: MI records
    MIPTY-->>Client: GdbOutputMsg (MI bridge)
    CLIPTY-->>GDBPane: WireTTY → xterm paint

    User->>IOPane: type hello
    IOPane->>InfPTY: WireTTY SendRaw
    InfPTY->>Prog: stdin
    Prog-->>InfPTY: stdout
    InfPTY-->>IOPane: WireTTY → xterm paint

    Note over CLIPTY,GDB: GDB exit
    GDB-->>CLIPTY: PTY close
    CLIPTY-->>GDBPane: OnExit → gdb-exit → app Exit
